TI  - Using Nd-Sr isotopes in suspended sediments in the Abrolhos coral-reef (SW Atlantic, Brazil) to assess potential contamination from the 2015 Fundao dam collapse
T2  - SCIENCE OF THE TOTAL ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
