TI  - Deep, diverse and definitely different: unique attributes of the world's largest ecosystem
T2  - BIOGEOSCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - CORAL LOPHELIA-PERTUSA
KW  - SHRIMP ARISTEUS-ANTENNATUS
KW  - CENTRAL ARCTIC-OCEAN
